somebody reads the books and helps him be so good on the air. And I would be really good at that job. That's what I felt like I could do. And so that's what I went to pursue. So what was the thing that made you feel like you could be good at that job, but that you didn't want to be a professional scientist that you were, you know, you were very close to getting your pH, I mean, you were 21 or some doogie house or age, but you were very close
