and I thought that graduate school was just going to be a continuation of being in college, which is what I really wanted to do. And so I just thought that this job of being a radio producer was kind of like being in college forever. And it turned out it kind of was. I write papers every week, I study things, you know, it's kind of just undergrad. I just never left Oberlin. I'm very grateful for the help that I have making this show. Kevin's on the line right now, so I wanted to, my producer,
