There's a new thing out, you had to put something out next week and it'll be fine. And I think that those two things help me as a podcaster because I think one of the issues with podcasting in general is people get into it and they love it and they love to be producing stuff and they love to be talking and connecting with people
有新东西出来了，你下周必须推出一些东西，一切都会好起来的。我认为这两件事对我作为播客制作者有所帮助，因为我认为一般播客的一个问题是，人们进入这个领域，他们喜欢它，他们喜欢制作内容，他们喜欢交谈并与人联系

